/* ============================================================
   API page Ã¢â‚¬â€ developer reference. Reuses the addon hero shell
   and the landing pipeline; adds endpoint cards, code blocks,
   and an honest roadmap list.
   ============================================================ */

/* hero terminal Ã¢â‚¬â€ addon-shot chrome with a code body instead of a screenshot */
